// The **Video** screen's player, and it is one node.
//
// `media-player` is the picture with its controls laid over it: `video-view`
// and `media-controls` in one box, found through the media module's catalog as
// `audio-player` is. `fit=` is how the picture fills the box: `contain` shows
// all of it, letterboxed.
//
// `player=` names the Video screen's own MediaPlayer, which the model registered
// as a named object (ADR-0170), and which the cards drive from Java too.
media-player id="video-player" player="video.player" fit="contain"
